OL,3,CTeen lifeguard rescues 10-year-old boy
OL,4,Cfrom massive waves in California
OL,6,FA 16-year-old California lifeguard
OL,7,Frescued a boy from powerful waves at
OL,8,FSanta Cruz's Seabright State Beach
OL,10,FA 16-year-old rookie lifeguard has
OL,11,Fbeen hailed a "hero" after he rescued
OL,12,Fa 10-year-old boy from huge waves off
OL,13,Fthe California coast over the weekend.
OL,15,FFootage captured by bystander Scott
OL,16,FVander Dussen shows the moment
OL,17,Flifeguard Ryder Williams dove into the
OL,18,Focean to save the boy, who was pulled
OL,19,Fin by powerful swells at Seabright
OL,20,FBeach in Santa Cruz.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
