OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785365285
OL,3,CTeen lifeguard rescues 10-year-old boy
OL,4,Cfrom massive waves in California
OL,6,FIn the video, the lifeguard can be
OL,7,Fseen diving into a coming wave while
OL,8,Fholding tight to the boy, who was
OL,9,Fgoing limp.
OL,11,FWilliams was struggling to bring the
OL,12,Fboy ashore, and several adults jumped
OL,13,Finto the water to help but then
OL,14,Fretreated after being knocked back by
OL,15,Fthe large swells again.
OL,17,FEventually, Williams and one of his
OL,18,Fcolleagues managed to get the child
OL,19,Fsafely out of the water. The operation
OL,20,Flasted just over two minutes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
