FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785365285
OL,3,CTeen lifeguard rescues 10-year-old boy
OL,4,Cfrom massive waves in California
OL,6,FThe young boy had no serious injuries
OL,7,Fand after a medical evaluation was
OL,8,Freleased tohisparents, according to
OL,9,Fa statement from the California State
OL,10,FParks, which employs the lifeguards at
OL,11,Fthat beach.
OL,13,FDussen told local TV station KNTV-TV
OL,14,Fthe conditions at sea were nothing out
OL,15,Fof the ordinary, but it "changed in a
OL,16,Fheartbeat".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
