OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785365285
OL,3,CTeen lifeguard rescues 10-year-old boy
OL,4,Cfrom massive waves in California
OL,6,F"It caught a lot of people off guard.
OL,7,FUnfortunately, this young man was
OL,8,Foverwhelmed and swept out in just a
OL,9,Fmoment's time. I'm glad it ended the
OL,10,Fway it did," he said.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FThe heroic rescue has also caught the
OL,18,Fattention of President Donald Trump,
OL,19,Fwho said that he would invite him to
OL,20,Fthe White House to receive a high
OL,21,Fcivilian honour.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
