OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785365285
OL,3,CTeen lifeguard rescues 10-year-old boy
OL,4,Cfrom massive waves in California
OL,6,F"We're going to bring this heroic
OL,7,Fyoung man, and his family, into the
OL,8,FWhite House with, perhaps, the boy he
OL,9,Fsaved, to give him a High Civilian
OL,10,FHonor. Very brave, he deserves it!"
OL,11,FTrump wrote on social media.
